WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.687
A fruit fly, on a peach.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.516
The ink washes away.

3
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:09.491
What is left is a wiring diagram,
recovered cell by cell.

4
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.159
One cell type lights up, and descends to a
leg.

5
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.827
Three fields, three different counts.

6
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.177
The animal flies off regardless.

7
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:22.985
A substrate, not a model.
